msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫For so long, I have been waiting.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"Waiting for the day I would be rid of this darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Por tanto tempo, eu estive esperando.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫Esperando pelo dia em que eu me livraria dessa escuridão."

