#: scenario7:scenario7_7F088681_CBC3_406F_B370_45C16AA79EFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef4f35be5e2ca6c0bc3eeecb4f2ce678415c0b2b8e8c53a306d57ab33b0a0353
#. default-sha256: 6f9267edf0b7b5919700f7204b7af8bb8f02993d75306dff403d773e47bcc475
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7F088681_CBC3_406F_B370_45C16AA79EFD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It felt like I was no longer in control of my own body.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Her voice was tender in a "
"way unlike either Mother’s or Aimee’s."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Parecia que eu não tinha mais controle sobre meu próprio corpo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sua voz era terna "
"de uma forma diferente da de Mãe ou Aimee."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E693A7E3_F555_4086_BBE8_BDB52E3857CF
