#: scenario7:scenario7_D4E5927C_C209_48BF_A235_21727A0C5234
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc8cae4e6b009e5f802565f84c16a61d9065e322787fe3aec9c43b66747c9d46
