#: scenario7:scenario7_E2088DD3_5F4E_4D55_B5A4_21971D01EB82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65f4aece77029ed2b41dfd741cd951c274342b9c23944945b8f7fbd897106984
