"⟪k:0⟫That I am.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I am the cursed witch, who loathes this puny, wretched world—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫curses it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Isso eu sou.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu sou a bruxa amaldiçoada, que detesta este mundo insignificante e "
"miserável—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫amaldiçoado seja."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B635749A_FC83_4FFC_A662_B0FD9832BB0B
